{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297917","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297917","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1029791701:1":{"text":"누군가 몰래 마차를 타고 간 것 같다는 보고를 받았는데...","source_cn":"我接到了报告，似乎有人偷偷搭着车——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE680178C11230C9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029791702:1":{"text":"맞아요. 간 것 같은 것도 아니고, 누군가도 아니고... 바로 이 용감한 칼라였답니다!","source_cn":"没错，不是似乎，也不是有人，正是我——勇敢的曼卡拉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF35C4062B4E5EC0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029791703:1":{"text":"브루투스 님, 화물칸은 생각보다 편했어요!","source_cn":"货厢里比想象得还舒服呢，布鲁特斯大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52427D88786EC7CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029791704:1":{"text":"다른 지역은 사막보다 습하긴 했는데, 피부에는 더 좋았어요!","source_cn":"虽说其他地方比起我们沙漠里面有些潮湿，但对皮肤更好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF49647F67F8016F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029791705:1":{"text":"아직 아무 말도 하지 않았는데 전부 실토했군...","source_cn":"我还什么都没说，你就自己全交代了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7B52F673321FB13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029791706:1":{"text":"됐다, 원래는 혼자서 멋대로 결정했다고 혼내려고 했는데, 별다른 일은 없었으니 그냥 넘어가도록 하지.","source_cn":"算了，本来想批评下你自作主张，但好像也没造成什么大影响...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB008DF6659002C6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029791707:1":{"text":"당연하죠. 위험 감지 능력은 경기장의 진행자가 반드시 갖춰야 할 능력이니까요!","source_cn":"那当然，判断危险程度可是擂台主持的必备技能！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x163505CE051DCA19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029791708:1":{"text":"브루투스 님은 이번 기회에 외출 안 하실 거예요?","source_cn":"倒是布鲁特斯大人，不打算趁机去外头玩玩吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4365102D9650E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029791709:1":{"text":"...음, 사막을 떠나본 것도 꽤 오래 전 일이 되었군.","source_cn":"……嗯，上次离开沙漠，也确实是很久之前了啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5D4B86F980E4709","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"브루투스","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"칼라","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}